# Kentico
# website: https://www.kentico.com/
# docs: https://docs.kentico.com/
# description: Ignores Kentico CMS and Xperience by Kentico runtime cache, search indexes, temporary files, and local configs.

# Continuous Integration & Deployment exceptions (must be tracked in source control)
!**/CIRepository/
!**/CIRepository/**
!**/CDRepository/repository.config

# Temporary runtime and cache files
**/App_Data/AzureCache/
**/App_Data/AzureTemp/
**/App_Data/CMSTemp/
**/App_Data/Persistent/
**/CMSApp_AppData/
**/CMSFiles/

# Site export and import packages
**/CMSSiteUtils/Export/
**/CMSSiteUtils/Import/

# Web farm and device profile sync markers
**/webfarm.sync
**/logFiftyOne.txt

# SmartSearch and Lucene index directories (excluding dictionary stop words and synonyms)
**/App_Data/CMSModules/SmartSearch/**
!**/App_Data/CMSModules/SmartSearch/*/
!**/App_Data/CMSModules/SmartSearch/_StopWords/**
!**/App_Data/CMSModules/SmartSearch/_Synonyms/**
**/App_Data/LuceneSearch/

# Sample and starter site templates (Dancing Goat, etc.)
**/App_Data/DancingGoat/
**/App_Themes/DancingGoat/
**/DancingGoat/

# Local configuration overrides (Classic .NET & Modern ASP.NET Core)
AppSettings.config
ConnectionStrings.config
appsettings.local.json
appsettings.*.local.json